{"data": {"event": {"id": "2eec64cb-40af-4e60-954a-9ecab1045121", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fce7", "voting": true, "title": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques en imagerie thoracique", "start": "2026-10-09T17:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T18:45+02:00", "objectives": ["<div>Ma\u00eetriser les principaux \u00e9l\u00e9ments s\u00e9miologiques en imagerie thoracique</div>", "<div>D\u00e9velopper un raisonnement diagnostique fond\u00e9 sur les gammes diagnostiques</div>", "<div>Identifier les principaux diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels des pathologies thoraciques courantes</div>", "<div>&nbsp;</div>", "<div>Texte de pr\u00e9sentation</div>", "<div>&nbsp;</div>", "<div>Cette s\u00e9ance interactive propose une approche pratique de l\u2019imagerie thoracique \u00e0 partir de cas cliniques didactiques pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s par des internes de radiologie, encadr\u00e9s par des experts de l'imagerie thoracique.</div>", "<div>Les diff\u00e9rents dossiers pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s permettront d\u2019illustrer la d\u00e9marche diagnostique en imagerie thoracique, d\u2019affiner l\u2019analyse s\u00e9miologique et de discuter les diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels dans des situations vari\u00e9es de pratique clinique.</div>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "ec511c62-e506-449e-98de-bdc85330f8d5", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre bleu", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "3351134f-dc3d-43d0-9e30-12f800ae1b84", "title": "Dossiers comment\u00e9s", "start": "2026-10-09T17:15+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T17:25+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "6b0c2c1b-c624-4508-856e-0a9de00c95ec", "lastName": "Cassagnes", "firstName": "Lucie", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=236700&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Cl